<h2>Reset your password</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password for your RevoShelf account. Click the button below to choose a new password.</p>

<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
  <tr>
    <td align="center">
      <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button" style="color: #ffffff; background-color: #038F78; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;">Reset Password</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin-top: 25px;">If the button doesn't work, you can copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p>
<p style="word-break: break-all; font-size: 14px; color: #71717a;"><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color: #038F78;">{{resetUrl}}</a></p>

<p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 12px; color: #71717a;">If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email; your password will remain secure. This link will expire in 1 hour.</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The RevoShelf Team</p>
